      "message": "\u003e Should this also be verifying that the calls that were made set the expected signals to the expected values, or are all of those chipset code? \n\nThese testcases are targeted only to board specific code, all the signals sequence at chipset level are already verified inside `zephyr/test/ap_power` using power signal emulator.\n\nWith `chipset_ap_power_action_g3_run` I am testing that `board_ap_power_action_g3_run` is returning value as expected.",
